        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I also ran into this and ended up using the devicons API to override icons for each file type, so this does allow some customisation: https://github.com/jackfranklin/dotfiles/commit/6aeece08fcb94935a326ac4feba148b0405db449\r\n\r\nThe problem is that I cannot override the default folder icon that mini.files uses. Even if that was exposed via a config option, and everything else was left to the user to configure via the devicons lua API, that would be hugely useful :)",
