        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "@jackfranklin just installing devicons makes telescope use it by default and last time I checked, telescope had no way to disable it unless when calling, so everytime you do `:Telescope ...` you'd have to set it...\r\n\r\nI never went through devicons features, but I tried some copy pasta from your configs and it works on some icons but not on others :sweat_smile: It did make all the telescope icons disappear though, but still not perfect on mini.files. Thanks for sharing!",
