            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is now possible on latest `main` with `content.prefix` option. It allows to not only customize icons, but assign any prefix user likes (including no icons).\r\n\r\nHere are [examples of how to use it](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4fd0f9c72fb54696442c81a64c71514c95239148/doc/mini-files.txt#L365) and here is [more detailed description of the feature](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4fd0f9c72fb54696442c81a64c71514c95239148/doc/mini-files.txt#L536-L543).",
